{
  "meta": {
    "source": "LoA-LSAG-LFMM_EN v5.0 (08/06/2026)",
    "scope": "Interface Geneva ACC (LSAG) <-> Marseille ACC (LFMM). Sections 2.2, 2.3, 3.1, 3.2.1 a 3.2.7.",
    "notScoped": "Section 0 (definitions) et 2.1 (classification d'espace) non encodees.",
    "conventions": [
      "Les cles a l'interieur d'un bloc 'when' se combinent en ET logique : {dep:[...], arr:[...]} = departs de X a destination de Y.",
      "'maxFl' = niveau maximum autorise (la LoA raisonne en MAX FL sur presque toutes les lignes), 'fl' = niveau exact impose.",
      "Le decoupage LFMM_W / LFMM_E par COP est deduit de la geographie et de l'AIP ENR 2.2.4.1 (secteurs LE, G, Y pour W ; MN, B pour E) : la LoA ne l'attribue pas COP par COP."
    ],
    "disclaimer": "FOR SIMULATION USE ONLY - NOT VALID FOR REAL OPERATIONS"
  },

  "stations": {
    "LSAG_INS_CTR": { "freq": "124.225", "name": "Swiss Radar (INS)", "fallback": [],
                      "note": "Position primaire. Couvre tout LSAG : INN, INE, INS, L1-L6 (SFC-UNL). Si LSAG_INS et LSAS_LM1 sont connectes, LSAG_INS est par defaut le seul secteur concerne par cette LoA (2.2.1)" },
    "LSAS_LM1_CTR": { "freq": "133.405", "name": "Swiss Radar (LSAS)", "fallback": ["LSAG_INS_CTR"],
                      "note": "SFC-UNL (LSAG et LSAZ). Gere la partie Zurich si LSAG_INS est ouvert ; peut, apres coordination, prendre l'espace superieur LSAG (FL245-UNL)" },
    "LSAG_L1_CTR":  { "freq": "134.850", "name": "Swiss Radar (L1)", "fallback": ["LSAG_INS_CTR", "LSAS_LM1_CTR"],
                      "note": "Secteurs L1-L6 (FL245-UNL)" },
    "LSAG_L4_CTR":  { "freq": "124.030", "name": "Swiss Radar (Upper 4)", "fallback": ["LSAG_L1_CTR", "LSAG_INS_CTR", "LSAS_LM1_CTR"],
                      "note": "Secteurs L4-L6 (FL335-UNL)" },
    "LSAG_LM6_CTR": { "freq": "133.690", "name": "Swiss Radar (LM6)", "fallback": ["LSAG_INS_CTR", "LSAS_LM1_CTR"],
                      "note": "LSAG et LSAZ superieur (FL245-UNL)" },
    "LSAG_INE_CTR": { "freq": "128.905", "name": "Swiss Radar (INE)", "fallback": ["LSAG_INS_CTR", "LSAS_LM1_CTR"] },
    "LSAG_INN_CTR": { "freq": "134.030", "name": "Swiss Radar (INN)", "fallback": ["LSAG_INS_CTR", "LSAS_LM1_CTR"] },
    "LSGG_APP":     { "freq": "136.255", "name": "Geneva Arrival", "fallback": ["LSAG_INS_CTR", "LSAS_LM1_CTR"] },
    "LSGG_DEP":     { "freq": "119.530", "name": "Geneva Departure", "fallback": ["LSGG_APP", "LSAG_INS_CTR", "LSAS_LM1_CTR"] },
    "LFMM_CTR":     { "freq": "128.850", "name": "Marseille Control", "fallback": [] },
    "LFMM_W_CTR":   { "freq": "132.635", "name": "Marseille Control (West)", "fallback": ["LFMM_CTR"],
                      "note": "Frequence 132.635 selon cette LoA ; la LoA LFBB-LFMM v7.1 indique 132.365 - divergence a arbitrer" },
    "LFMM_E_CTR":   { "freq": "127.905", "name": "Marseille Control (East)", "fallback": ["LFMM_CTR"] },
    "LFLL_APP":     { "freq": "136.075", "name": "Lyon Approach", "fallback": ["LFMM_W_CTR", "LFMM_CTR"] },
    "LFLB_APP":     { "freq": "121.205", "name": "Chambery Approach", "fallback": ["LFLL_APP", "LFMM_W_CTR", "LFMM_CTR"],
                      "note": "Si LFLL_APP est connecte et LFLB_APP hors ligne, LFLL_APP est responsable de l'espace de Chambery (2.2.5)" }
  },

  "groups": {
    "LSGG_TMA": ["LSGG", "LSGL", "LSGP", "LFLI", "LFHN"],
    "LSAG_CTA": ["LSGC", "LSGS", "LSGK", "LSMP"],
    "LSZ_NORTH": ["LSZB", "LSZC", "LSZG", "LSME", "LSMA"],
    "NORTH_GROUP": ["LSZH", "LSMD", "EDTD", "EDTM", "LSZA", "LFSB", "LFSM", "LFGB", "LFGA"],
    "LIM_NORTH": ["LIMA", "LIMB", "LIMC", "LIME", "LIMG", "LIML", "LIMN", "LIMP", "LIMS", "LSZL", "LSZA", "LSZS"],
    "LYON_ARR": ["LFLL", "LFLY", "LFLS", "LFHS", "LFHV", "LFLM"],
    "NICE_GROUP": ["LFMD", "LFMN", "LFMF", "LFTZ", "LFMC", "LFTF", "LFTH"],
    "BARCELONA_GROUP": ["LEBL", "LEGE", "LERS", "LELL", "LEDA"]
  },

  "defaults": {
    "accToApp": { "level": { "coordination": true },
      "note": "Cette LoA ne definit pas de niveau ACC->APP generique : voir 3.2.3 (LSAG ACC -> Lyon APP, FL110 par AMKEN)" },
    "appToAcc": { "level": { "coordination": true },
      "note": "Cette LoA ne definit pas de niveau APP->ACC generique : voir 3.2.4 a 3.2.7" },
    "general": [
      "La coordination se fait par reference au COP de la route concernee et aux niveaux du 3.2.",
      "Le trafic est repute maintenir le niveau coordonne au point de transfert de controle sauf condition de montee/descente explicite (3.1).",
      "Toute deviation (COP, route, FL) impose une approval request de l'organisme transferant (3.1).",
      "Le transfert de controle a lieu a la limite d'AoR (3.1).",
      "Le transfert de communication a lieu des que possible, degage de tout conflit, au plus tard au transfert de controle, si possible au moins 1 minute avant la limite d'AoR (3.1).",
      "Silent handover possible a 10 NM minimum ; si separation longitudinale < 20 NM, vitesses assignees aux deux avions, le leader >= le suiveur, report de la vitesse assignee au premier contact (3.1).",
      "A l'ouverture, Geneve informe Marseille de la piste en service a Geneve (3.1).",
      "A l'ouverture, Lyon (ou Marseille) informe Geneve de la piste en service a Lyon (3.1)."
    ]
  },

  "rules": [

    { "id": "lsag-argis", "ref": "3.2.1", "from": "LSAG", "to": "LFMM_W_CTR",
      "routes": ["MILPA-ARGIS", "MILPA-NUSBA-ARGIS", "ARGIS-DEPUL-LSE"],
      "cop": ["ARGIS"],
      "level": { "parity": "odd" },
      "exceptions": [
        { "when": { "arr": ["LFLU", "LFMH"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 270 },
          "note": "Route MILPA-NUSBA-ARGIS" },
        { "when": { "dep": ["LSGG", "LSGL", "LSGP", "LFLI", "LFHN"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 190 },
          "note": "Route ARGIS-DEPUL-LSE. Ces trafics doivent franchir DEPUL a FL150 ou au-dessus, sinon Geneve coordonne le trafic avec Lyon APP (3.2.1.1)" }
      ] },

    { "id": "lsag-nintu", "ref": "3.2.1", "from": "LSAG", "to": "LFMM_W_CTR",
      "routes": ["MILPA-NINTU-MEBAK", "DCT NINTU"],
      "cop": ["NINTU"],
      "level": { "parity": "odd" },
      "exceptions": [
        { "when": { "dep": ["LSZH", "LSZA", "LSZS", "LSMD", "EDTD", "EDTM", "LFSB", "LFSM", "LFGB", "LFGA"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 370 } },
        { "when": { "arr": ["LFCR"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 350 } },
        { "when": { "arr": ["LFLC", "LFLV", "LFLO", "LFLN"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 310 } },
        { "when": { "dep": ["LSZB", "LSZC", "LSZG", "LSME", "LSMA", "LSGC", "LSGS", "LSGK", "LSMP"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 310 } }
      ] },

    { "id": "lsag-balsi", "ref": "3.2.1", "from": "LSAG", "to": "LFMM_W_CTR",
      "routes": ["MILPA-ONNOF-BALSI", "GEVEA-INCUS-BALSI", "DCT BALSI"],
      "cop": ["BALSI"],
      "level": { "parity": "odd", "forbidden": [210] },
      "exceptions": [
        { "when": { "dep": ["LSZH", "LSMD", "EDTD", "EDTM", "LSZA", "LFSB", "LFSM", "LFGB", "LFGA"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 370 } },
        { "when": { "arr": ["LFHO", "LFMA", "LFMI", "LFML", "LFMO", "LFMV", "LFMY", "LFMQ", "LFMT", "LFMU", "LFTW"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 350 } },
        { "when": { "dep": ["LSZH", "LSMD", "EDTD", "EDTM", "LSZA", "LFSB", "LFSM", "LFGB", "LFGA"],
                    "arr": ["LEBL", "LEGE", "LERS", "LELL", "LEDA"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 350 } },
        { "when": { "dep": ["LSZB", "LSZC", "LSZG", "LSME", "LSMA", "LSGC", "LSGS", "LSGK", "LSMP"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 310 } }
      ] },

    { "id": "lsag-pas-balsi-04", "ref": "3.2.1", "from": "LSAG", "to": "LFMM_W_CTR",
      "routes": ["PAS-BALSI"], "cop": ["BALSI"],
      "when": { "dep": ["LSGG", "LSGL", "LSGP", "LFLI", "LFHN"], "config": "LSGG QFU 04" },
      "level": { "maxFl": 190 },
      "note": "Etabli sur la trajectoire PAS-BALSI au plus tard a RUMIL en montee FL190 ; FL190 atteint au plus tard a la limite d'AoR (TMA 9 Geneve). Marseille ACC separe ces trafics de ceux partant de Lyon par SID RISOR vers GEMLA ou ASLEG (3.2.1.2)" },

    { "id": "lsag-pas-balsi-22", "ref": "3.2.1", "from": "LSAG", "to": "LFMM_W_CTR",
      "routes": ["PAS-BALSI"], "cop": ["BALSI"],
      "when": { "dep": ["LSGG", "LSGL", "LSGP", "LFLI", "LFHN"], "config": "LSGG QFU 22" },
      "level": { "maxFl": 150 },
      "note": "Etabli sur la trajectoire PAS-BALSI au plus tard a BEVEN en montee FL150 ; FL150 atteint au plus tard a BEVEN (3.2.1.2)" },

    { "id": "lsag-gigus", "ref": "3.2.1", "from": "LSAG", "to": "LFMM_W_CTR",
      "routes": ["RONOP-GIGUS-BALSI"], "cop": ["GIGUS"],
      "level": { "parity": "even" },
      "exceptions": [
        { "when": { "arr": ["LFLC", "LFLV", "LFLO", "LFLN"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 340 } },
        { "when": { "dep": ["LIMA", "LIMB", "LIMC", "LIME", "LIMG", "LIML", "LIMN", "LIMP", "LIMS", "LSZL", "LSZA", "LSZS"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 340 } },
        { "when": { "dep": ["LIMF", "LIMW", "LIMZ"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 320 } },
        { "when": { "arr": ["LFMH"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 300 } }
      ] },

    { "id": "lsag-gigus-amvar", "ref": "3.2.1", "from": "LSAG", "to": "LFMM_W_CTR",
      "routes": ["GIGUS-AMVAR-OSMAS"], "cop": ["GIGUS"],
      "when": { "arr": ["LFLL", "LFLY", "LFLS", "LFLU", "LFLB", "LFLP"] },
      "level": { "maxFl": 200 },
      "note": "Reserve a ces arrivees (ONLY). LTA Alpes et relief : trafic etabli sur GIGUS-AMVAR au plus tard a GIGUS. Geneve etablit dans la mesure du possible une sequence entre arrivees successives ; a defaut FL210 peut etre utilise (3.2.1.3)" },

    { "id": "lsag-vevar-barso", "ref": "3.2.1", "from": "LSAG", "to": "LFMM_E_CTR",
      "routes": ["MEDAM-VEVAR-BARSO"], "cop": ["VEVAR"],
      "level": { "parity": "odd" },
      "exceptions": [
        { "when": { "dep": ["LSGC", "LSGS", "LSGK", "LSMP", "LSGG", "LSGL", "LSGP", "LFLI", "LFHN", "LSZB", "LSZC", "LSZG", "LSME", "LSMA"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 330 } }
      ] },

    { "id": "lsag-vevar-gapdo", "ref": "3.2.1", "from": "LSAG", "to": "LFMM_E_CTR",
      "routes": ["MEDAM-VEVAR-GAPDO"], "cop": ["VEVAR"],
      "level": { "parity": "odd" },
      "exceptions": [
        { "when": { "arr": ["LFMD", "LFMN", "LFMF", "LFTZ", "LFMC", "LFTF", "LFTH"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 330 } },
        { "when": { "dep": ["LSGG", "LSGL", "LSGP", "LFLI", "LFHN", "LSGC", "LSGS", "LSGK", "LSMP"],
                    "arr": ["LFMD", "LFMN", "LFMF", "LFTZ", "LFMC", "LFTF", "LFTH"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 230 } }
      ],
      "note": "Le tableau renvoie a 3.2.1.1 sur la ligne FL230, ce renvoi parait errone (3.2.1.1 traite de DEPUL)" },

    { "id": "lfmm-ronla", "ref": "3.2.2", "from": "LFMM_W", "to": "LSAG_INS_CTR",
      "routes": ["MABES-RONLA-MOREG"], "cop": ["RONLA"],
      "when": { "dep": ["LFLL", "LFLY", "LFLN"] },
      "level": { "maxFl": 190, "trend": "climbing" },
      "note": "Via L47. Transferes a Swiss Radar en montee FL190 ; FL190 atteint au plus tard a RONLA (3.2.2.1)" },

    { "id": "lfmm-asleg", "ref": "3.2.2", "from": "LFMM_W", "to": "LSAG_INS_CTR",
      "routes": ["RISOR-ASLEG"], "cop": ["ASLEG"],
      "when": { "dep": ["LFLL", "LFLY", "LFLS"] },
      "level": { "maxFl": 220 },
      "note": "Reserve a ces departs (ONLY). Clairance FL220 (ou RFL si inferieur mais pas sous FL160), FL200 minimum a ASLEG. Si impossible ou si RFL<195, Marseille initie une coordination avec Swiss Radar (3.2.2.2)" },

    { "id": "lfmm-gemla", "ref": "3.2.2", "from": "LFMM_W", "to": "LSAG_INS_CTR",
      "routes": ["RISOR-GEMLA"], "cop": ["GEMLA"],
      "when": { "dep": ["LFLL", "LFLY", "LFLS"] },
      "level": { "maxFl": 220 },
      "note": "Reserve a ces departs (ONLY). Clairance FL220 (ou FL210 si RFL) pour etre en palier a GEMLA. Si impossible, Marseille initie une coordination avec Swiss Radar (3.2.2.2)" },

    { "id": "lfmm-belus-22", "ref": "3.2.2", "from": "LFMM_W", "to": "LSGG_APP",
      "routes": ["BELUS-RILTI-CBY"], "cop": ["BELUS"],
      "when": { "arr": ["LSGG", "LSGL", "LSGP", "LFLI", "LFHN"], "config": "LSGG QFU 22" },
      "level": { "fl": 180, "at": "RILTI" },
      "note": "Reserve a ces arrivees (ONLY). STAR BELUS *R, FL180 niveau par RILTI. LSGG_APP informe Marseille quand l'attente CBY est active ; attente CBY active = coordination Marseille -> LSGG_APP pour chaque arrivee (3.2.2.3)" },

    { "id": "lfmm-belus-04", "ref": "3.2.2", "from": "LFMM_W", "to": "LSGG_APP",
      "routes": ["BELUS-RILTI-CBY"], "cop": ["BELUS"],
      "when": { "arr": ["LSGG", "LSGL", "LSGP", "LFLI", "LFHN"], "config": "LSGG QFU 04" },
      "level": { "fl": 150, "trend": "descending" },
      "note": "STAR BELUS *N, en descente FL150 avec restriction FL160 ou moins a BELUS, vitesse stabilisee a 250 kt a BELUS (3.2.2.3)" },

    { "id": "lfmm-omasi", "ref": "3.2.2", "from": "LFMM_W", "to": "LSAG_INS_CTR",
      "routes": ["GIPNO-SOPLO-OMASI"], "cop": ["OMASI"],
      "level": { "parity": "even" },
      "exceptions": [
        { "when": { "arr": ["LFSB", "LFSM", "LFGA", "LFGB", "LFST", "LFSN", "LFJL", "LSZH", "LSMD", "LSZA", "LSZR", "LSZS", "EDNY", "EDTD", "EDTM"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 320 } },
        { "when": { "arr": ["LSZB", "LSZG", "LSZC", "LSME", "LSMA"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 280 } },
        { "when": { "dep": ["LFLC", "LFLV", "LFLN", "LFLO", "LFMH", "LFLU"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 280 } },
        { "when": { "arr": ["LSGC", "LSGS", "LSMP"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 260 } },
        { "when": { "arr": ["LSGK", "LSTS"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 240 } }
      ] },

    { "id": "lfmm-robex", "ref": "3.2.2", "from": "LFMM_W", "to": "LSAG_INS_CTR",
      "routes": ["BALSI-ROBEX-BLONA"], "cop": ["ROBEX"],
      "level": { "parity": "odd", "forbidden": [210] },
      "exceptions": [
        { "when": { "arr": ["LIMJ", "LIP*", "LIRZ"], "arrExcept": ["LIPZ"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 370 } },
        { "when": { "arr": ["LIMA", "LIMB", "LIMC", "LIME", "LIMG", "LIML", "LIMN", "LIMP", "LIMS", "LSZL", "LSZA", "LSZS"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 270 } },
        { "when": { "arr": ["LIMF", "LIMW", "LIMZ"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 230 } }
      ],
      "note": "Marseille ACC considere BALSI-BLONA et NEDRU-BLONA comme un axe unique et assure la separation a BLONA (3.2.2.4)" },

    { "id": "lfmm-emmef", "ref": "3.2.2", "from": "LFMM_W", "to": "LSAG_INS_CTR",
      "routes": ["NEDRU-EMMEF-BLONA"], "cop": ["EMMEF"],
      "level": { "parity": "odd", "forbidden": [210] },
      "exceptions": [
        { "when": { "arr": ["LIMJ", "LIP*", "LIRZ"], "arrExcept": ["LIPZ"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 370 } },
        { "when": { "arr": ["LIMA", "LIMB", "LIMC", "LIME", "LIMG", "LIML", "LIMN", "LIMP", "LIMS", "LSZL", "LSZA", "LSZS"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 270 } },
        { "when": { "arr": ["LIMF", "LIMW", "LIMZ"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 230 } }
      ],
      "note": "Marseille ACC considere BALSI-BLONA et NEDRU-BLONA comme un axe unique et assure la separation a BLONA (3.2.2.4)" },

    { "id": "lfmm-irmar", "ref": "3.2.2", "from": "LFMM_E", "to": "LSAG_INS_CTR",
      "routes": ["OKTET-IRMAR", "BARSO-IRMAR"], "cop": ["IRMAR"],
      "level": { "parity": "even" },
      "exceptions": [
        { "when": { "arr": ["LSZH", "LSMD", "LSZA", "LSZR", "LSZS", "EDNY", "EDTD", "EDTM", "LFSB", "LFSM", "LFGA", "LFGB"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 340 } },
        { "when": { "arr": ["LSGC", "LSGS", "LSGK", "LSMP", "LSZB", "LSZG", "LSZC", "LSME", "LSMA", "LSGG", "LSGL", "LSGP", "LFLI", "LFHN"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 300 } },
        { "when": { "dep": ["LFMD", "LFMN", "LFMF", "LFTZ", "LFTH", "LFTF", "LFMC"] }, "level": { "maxFl": 260 } },
        { "when": { "dep": ["LFMD", "LFMN", "LFMF", "LFTZ", "LFTH", "LFTF", "LFMC"],
                    "arr": ["LSGG", "LSGL", "LSGP", "LFLI", "LFHN", "LSGC", "LSGS", "LSGK", "LSMP", "LSZB", "LSZG", "LSZC", "LSME", "LSMA"] },
          "level": { "maxFl": 240 } }
      ] },

    { "id": "lsag-lfll-milpa", "ref": "3.2.3", "from": "LSAG", "to": "LFLL_APP",
      "routes": ["STAR MILPA"], "cop": ["MILPA", "AMKEN"],
      "when": { "arr": ["LFLL", "LFLY", "LFLS", "LFHS", "LFHV", "LFLM"], "rflAbove": 155 },
      "level": { "fl": 110, "at": "AMKEN", "trend": "descending" },
      "note": "Transfert direct LSAG ACC -> Lyon APP. Sauf coordination, FL110 en palier a AMKEN ou avant avec 10 NM de separation longitudinale ; si 10 NM impossible, transfert avec separation verticale. STAR MILPA *N (LFLL RWY 35) ou *S (LFLL RWY 17) ; LFLS equipe RNAV via MILPA *A. Conflit entre une arrivee MILPA RFL>155 (LSAG ACC) et une arrivee MILPA RFL<155 (Geneva APP) : LSAG ACC coordonne avec Geneva APP. Attente RIPTU : Lyon APP indique le premier FL utilisable et transmet l'EAT si disponible (3.2.3)" },

    { "id": "lsgg-lfll-argis", "ref": "3.2.4", "from": "LSGG_APP", "to": "LFLL_APP",
      "routes": ["T544", "Z66"], "cop": ["ARGIS"],
      "level": { "allowed": [90, 110, 130] },
      "note": "Les vols non-RNAV a destination de LFLS sont transferes a Lyon APP via ARGIS-DEPUL a FL090 et coordonnes avec Lyon APP. Les vols sur T544/Z66 a FL090 ou en dessous sont coordonnes avec Lyon APP (3.2.4.1)" },

    { "id": "lsgg-lfll-milpa", "ref": "3.2.4", "from": "LSGG_APP", "to": "LFLL_APP",
      "routes": ["STAR MILPA"], "cop": ["AMKEN"],
      "when": { "arr": ["LFLS", "LFLL", "LFLY", "LFHS", "LFHV", "LFLM"], "rflBelow": 155 },
      "level": { "maxFl": 110, "at": "AMKEN" },
      "note": "STAR MILPA *N (LFLL RWY 35) ou *S (LFLL RWY 17) ; LFLS equipe RNAV via MILPA *A. Sauf coordination, FL110 en palier a AMKEN ou avant avec 10 NM ; sinon separation verticale. Attente RIPTU : Lyon APP indique le premier FL utilisable et l'EAT (3.2.4.2)" },

    { "id": "lsgg-lfll-depul", "ref": "3.2.4", "from": "LSGG_APP", "to": "LFLL_APP",
      "routes": ["SID DEPUL", "DCT AMKEN"], "cop": ["AMKEN"],
      "when": { "dep": ["LSGG", "LSGL", "LSGP", "LFLI", "LFHN"],
                "arr": ["LFLS", "LFLL", "LFLY", "LFHS", "LFHV", "LFLM", "LFLO", "LFLN"] },
      "level": { "maxFl": 80 },
      "note": "Vols avec RFL>145 : franchir DEPUL a FL150 ou au-dessus, sinon Geneve coordonne le vol avec Lyon APP. Vols avec RFL<145 : transferes a Lyon APP a FL080 (3.2.4.3)" },

    { "id": "lfll-lsgg-z16", "ref": "3.2.5", "from": "LFLL_APP", "to": "LSGG_APP",
      "routes": ["Z16"], "cop": ["CBY"],
      "level": { "allowed": [80, 100] },
      "note": "Transits via BELUS-PAS" },

    { "id": "lfll-lsgg-n871", "ref": "3.2.5", "from": "LFLL_APP", "to": "LSGG_APP",
      "routes": ["N871"], "cop": ["NAVLA"],
      "level": { "allowed": [120, 140] },
      "exceptions": [
        { "when": { "dep": ["LFLU"], "rflBelow": 145 }, "level": { "maxFl": 120 } }
      ],
      "note": "Transits via LTP-MOLUS" },

    { "id": "lfll-lsgg-z32-lfll", "ref": "3.2.5", "from": "LFLL_APP", "to": "LSGG_APP",
      "routes": ["Z32"], "cop": ["RONLA"],
      "when": { "dep": ["LFLL", "LFLY"], "rflBelow": 145 },
      "level": { "maxFl": 100 } },

